{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_124_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_124","textTraditional":"一、十年，春，公如齊。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_124_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_124","textTraditional":"二、公至自齊。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_124_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_124","textTraditional":"三、齊人歸我濟西田。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_124_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_124","textTraditional":"公娶齊，齊由以為兄弟反之。不言來，公如齊受之也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_124_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_124","textTraditional":"四、夏，四月，丙辰，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_124_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_124","textTraditional":"五、己巳，齊侯元卒。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_124_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_124","textTraditional":"六、齊崔氏出奔衞。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_124_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_124","textTraditional":"氏者，舉族而出之之辭也。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_124_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_124","textTraditional":"七、公如齊。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_124_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_124","textTraditional":"八、公至自齊。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_124_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_124","textTraditional":"九、癸巳，陳夏徵舒弒其君平國。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_124_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_124","textTraditional":"十、六月，宋師伐滕。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_clt_124_13","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_124","textTraditional":"十一、公孫歸父如齊，葬齊惠公。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_clt_124_14","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_124","textTraditional":"十二、晉人、宋人、衞人、曹人伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_clt_124_15","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_124","textTraditional":"十三、秋，天王使王季子來聘。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_clt_124_16","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_124","textTraditional":"其曰王季，王子也。其曰子，尊之也。聘，問也。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_clt_124_17","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_124","textTraditional":"十四、公孫歸父帥師伐邾，取繹。","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_clt_124_18","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_124","textTraditional":"十五、大水。","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_clt_124_19","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_124","textTraditional":"十六、季孫行父如齊。","sentenceOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_clt_124_20","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_124","textTraditional":"十七、冬，公孫歸父如齊。","sentenceOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_clt_124_21","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_124","textTraditional":"十八、齊侯使國佐來聘。","sentenceOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_clt_124_22","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_124","textTraditional":"十九、饑。","sentenceOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_clt_124_23","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_124","textTraditional":"二十、楚子伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":23}],"overrides":{}}